sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant ArgoSvc as argo-server Service<br/>ClusterIP 2746/TCP
    participant ArgoAPI as argo-server<br/>HTTPS/2746<br/>REST + gRPC-gateway
    participant AuthGK as Auth Gatekeeper<br/>(per-request K8s client)
    participant IdP as Identity Provider<br/>(OAuth2/OIDC)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    participant WFCtrl as workflow-controller<br/>Leader Election (Lease)
    participant ArgoExec as argoexec Sidecar<br/>User: 2000
    participant Storage as Artifact Storage<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure/OSS/HDFS)
    participant DB as Archive DB<br/>(MySQL/PostgreSQL/SQLite)

    Note over ArgoAPI: FIPS 140 crypto<br/>readOnlyRootFilesystem<br/>drop ALL capabilities

    %% SSO Authentication Flow
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,IdP: OAuth2/OIDC SSO Authentication
        Client->>ArgoAPI: GET /oauth2/redirect
        ArgoAPI->>IdP: Redirect to IdP
        IdP-->>Client: Auth prompt
        Client->>IdP: Credentials
        IdP-->>ArgoAPI: GET /oauth2/callback (auth code)
        ArgoAPI->>IdP: Exchange code for token<br/>(go-oidc/v3, golang.org/x/oauth2)
        IdP-->>ArgoAPI: ID Token + Access Token
        ArgoAPI-->>Client: Session / Token
    end

    %% Workflow Submission Flow
    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        Note over Client,K8sAPI: Workflow Submission
        Client->>ArgoSvc: POST /api/v1/workflows<br/>Bearer Token
        ArgoSvc->>ArgoAPI: Forward (TCP/2746)
        ArgoAPI->>AuthGK: Authenticate request
        AuthGK->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>AuthGK: Allowed/Denied
        AuthGK-->>ArgoAPI: Auth result
        ArgoAPI->>K8sAPI: Create Workflow CR
        K8sAPI-->>ArgoAPI: Workflow created
        ArgoAPI-->>Client: 200 OK + Workflow status
    end

    %% Workflow Execution Flow
    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over WFCtrl,Storage: Workflow Execution
        K8sAPI->>WFCtrl: Watch: Workflow CR event
        WFCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Pod (with argoexec sidecar)
        WFCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMap<br/>(workflow state)
        K8sAPI-->>ArgoExec: Pod scheduled
        ArgoExec->>Storage: Download input artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443
        Storage-->>ArgoExec: Artifact data
        Note over ArgoExec: Execute workflow step
        ArgoExec->>Storage: Upload output artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443
        ArgoExec->>K8sAPI: Update WorkflowTaskResult CR
        K8sAPI->>WFCtrl: Watch: TaskResult event
        WFCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update Workflow status
    end

    %% Archival Flow
    rect rgb(255, 245, 255)
        Note over WFCtrl,DB: Workflow Archival
        WFCtrl->>DB: Archive completed workflow<br/>(MySQL/PostgreSQL/SQLite)
        DB-->>WFCtrl: Archived
    end

    %% Health & Metrics
    Note over WFCtrl: Health: GET /healthz (HTTP/6060)<br/>Metrics: /metrics (HTTP/9090)
